    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Your egg was incubated by a violet drachiri, and your body has been imbued by their influence. You have reflective scales and might have a prominent horn on your snout or forehead, both of which resemble metal or gemstones. </span>You gain a second trait from your Violet Drachiri benefactor.<span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"> You gain a +1 circumstance bonus to saving throws against Mental effects. Whenever you succeed on a saving throw against </span>an emotion or fear effect, you get a critical success instead.</p>"
    },
